COMMENT    The statistical uncertainty is estimated to be
            0.3-3.0%, the uncertainty of the energy spectrum is
            4.50% above 0.15 MeV, and 8.00% below 0.15 MeV.
            (Gao-Le Yang, 2026.07.07)
